<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Union Pacific said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Union Pacific said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber upgraded Union Pacific Corp to attractive from neutral, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- One market source said the firm had a price target on the stock in the low $70s.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Wednesday at 60.</p>
</text>
